@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001
@token = replace-with-access-token
@tenantId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@projectId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@messageId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
@sourceId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004

### Current source (replace IDs with a persisted AI citation; also supports glossary, decision, artifact)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/messages/{{messageId}}/references/spec/{{sourceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Project-Id: {{projectId}}

### Missing or uncited source returns 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/messages/{{messageId}}/references/spec/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Project-Id: {{projectId}}
